    <string name="sms_disclosure_message">Financier checks messages from supported banks for balance and transaction alerts. Matching messages are processed on this device. Transaction details and the matching message text are stored in the encrypted app database to prevent duplicates. Old messages are scanned only when you tap Scan Old SMS. The original SMS text is not sent to the AI service; if you use AI features, financial summaries and your prompts may be sent to Gemini. SMS access is optional, and other app features work if you decline.</string>
